      "text": "APIs\n\nPOST /transactions/hold\n-> {\ntx_id\nmerchant_id\nbill_amount\naccount_info: {\n   }\n}\n<- {\n\"status\": \"success\" | \"failed\"\n}\n\nPOST /orders/charge\n-> {\ntx_id\namount\ntip\n}\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
